8. Let the applicant - Lokendra, be released on bail on his executing a personal bond and furnishing two reliable sureties, each in the like amount, to the satisfaction of the court concerned with the following conditions :-
i) Applicant shall make himself available for interrogation by the Investigating Officer as and when requires;
ii) Applicant shall not directly or indirectly make any inducement, threat or promise to any person acquainted with the facts of this case;
9.

